      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "For more than two thousand years, philosophers have tried to answer one question.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.467
        },
        {
          "text": "What does it take to be happy?",
          "start": 4.887,
          "end": 6.493
        },
        {
          "text": "Their answers don't agree.",
          "start": 7.193,
          "end": 8.989
        },
        {
          "text": "Each one goes a little deeper than the last.",
          "start": 9.319,
          "end": 11.763
        },
        {
          "text": "So let's go down, one step at a time.",
          "start": 12.383,
          "end": 14.742
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "s02-epicurus",
      "asset_id": "narr-s02-epicurus",
      "route": "tts",
      "path": "narration/s02-epicurus/4c3bfc6347cfa382.wav",
      "sha256": "7cbae1332f8ebfa03ba1dfec6aa211d67b5156eaea85ac26e089e5c014cd15c8",
      "fingerprint": "4c3bfc6347cfa3822eb9fff9d2b7e7a526053f3c9356b4c73a050b9352df5445",
      "cached": false,
      "duration_seconds": 24.06,
      "sample_rate": 48000,
      "channels": 1,
      "integrated_lufs": -20.2,
      "true_peak_dbtp": -2.3,
      "leading_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "trailing_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "At the top is Epicurus.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.786
        },
        {
          "text": "In a garden in Athens, he taught his friends that pleasure is the point of life.",
          "start": 2.206,
          "end": 6.286
        },
        {
          "text": "But not the pleasure you might think.",
          "start": 6.836,
          "end": 8.841
        },
        {
          "text": "In his words: it is impossible to live a pleasant life without living wisely and well and justly, and it is impossible to live wisely and well and justly without living pleasantly.",
          "start": 9.171,
          "end": 19.863
        },
        {
          "text": "For Epicurus, a good life and a happy life were the same life.",
          "start": 20.483,
          "end": 24.043
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "s03-aristotle",
      "asset_id": "narr-s03-aristotle",
      "route": "tts",
      "path": "narration/s03-aristotle/00ba58ed205a6ab0.wav",
      "sha256": "b2ea684d733019b1fd51d210aad4181f44cbfd1f2626998d97c934dc2b12d3b8",
      "fingerprint": "00ba58ed205a6ab06fdb1f811e54c0a5a39c86a45c2b10a7265a3fd6117c3e6c",
      "cached": false,
      "duration_seconds": 20.093,
      "sample_rate": 48000,
      "channels": 1,
      "integrated_lufs": -20.1,
