      "leading_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "trailing_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "One step down is Aristotle.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.086
        },
        {
          "text": "For him, happiness isn't a feeling you have.",
          "start": 2.506,
          "end": 5.005
        },
        {
          "text": "It's something you do: living out what you are best at, and doing it well.",
          "start": 5.555,
          "end": 9.223
        },
        {
          "text": "And it takes time.",
          "start": 9.553,
          "end": 10.864
        },
        {
          "text": "As he put it: it is not one swallow or one fine day that makes a spring, so it is not one day or a short time that makes a man blessed and happy.",
          "start": 11.484,
          "end": 20.075
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "s04-stoics",
      "asset_id": "narr-s04-stoics",
      "route": "tts",
      "path": "narration/s04-stoics/c6b1c5b18ef53ad9.wav",
      "sha256": "81e1ac5f50d32c5c6b709f9bbb5de37d414bc68948db95d7f5887a0ea3827592",
      "fingerprint": "c6b1c5b18ef53ad926352693def3d80d23d29df58479621ac2c1d362bb6deccb",
      "cached": false,
      "duration_seconds": 19.365,
